        resolved_configs: dict[CellId_t, CellConfig],
    ) -> None:
        """Build and broadcast a NotebookDocumentTransactionNotification.

        Maps the queued internal ops to the structured transaction ops
        (create-cell / delete-cell / set-code / set-config) and always
        appends a reorder-cells op capturing the full cell ordering.
        Moves are captured by the reorder-cells op alone.
